<LegalPage title="18+ notice" eyebrow="Before you read" description="Dark Romance Fan is for adult readers only. What the books on the site can include, and what we don't publish.">
  <p><strong>Dark Romance Fan is for adults aged 18 and over.</strong> By using the site, commenting or joining the newsletter, you confirm that you are 18 or older.</p>

  <h2>What dark romance can include</h2>
  <p>The books on this site are fiction written for adults, and dark romance goes to dark places: violence, stalking, kidnapping and captivity, coercion, dubious or non-consent, abuse and death all turn up. Featuring a book is not an endorsement of anything that happens in it.</p>

  <h2>Content notes</h2>
  <p>Book pages mention specifics where they're useful, like a cliffhanger ending. For the full list, the author's own trigger warnings are the source.</p>

  <h2>What we don't publish</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Explicit excerpts. Blurbs and lists describe books without graphic detail.</li>
    <li>Books whose romantic leads are under 18.</li>
    <li>Explicit or abusive comments. Comments are moderated, and big spoilers must be hidden with ||double bars||.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Look after yourself</h2>
  <p>If something you read brings up difficult feelings, step away and talk to someone you trust. In the UK, Samaritans are available on 116 123; in the US, call or text 988.</p>
</LegalPage>
